      "description": "The OpenAPI subgraph — a NAMED SUBGRAPH of the harness, and until 2026-10-07 an instance of its own, `cat-openapi` (repository never created). Owner, 2026-10-07: *\"put cat-openapi under cat-harness as named subgraph 'openapi', not separate repo.\"* It holds the machinery for OpenAPI 3 documents rather than documents: the graph typology `openapi` an instance declares to hold one, the validator for that kind's provenance node, the shapes (`cat-openapi.config.json`, provenance, the subset of OpenAPI 3 the pages read) and the rendering sub-pipeline that gives every operation a page and an IRI. Of graph typology `cat-harness` because it holds MORE THAN ONE of the harness's parts; the four graphs inside it — `openapi-validators`, `openapi-typologies`, `openapi-schemas`, `openapi-scripts` — are declared FROM WITHIN, in `openapi/graph.json` (#980), never reached down to from here. Bean `s4ta`.",
